<title>RUSSIA: WEATHER - Conditions at CIS airports - November 12.</title>
<headline>WEATHER - Conditions at CIS airports - November 12.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morning fog may cause delays at airports in the Northern Caucasus and central European Russia on November 13, the Russian Weather Service said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Moscow Newsroom +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
